{"name":"Hidden Diary","hex":"#ede4cc","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"hidden","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["past participle of hide"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Located or positioned out of sight; not visually apparent.","Obscure. (Can we add an example for this sense?)"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/hidden"},{"term":"diary","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A daily log of experiences, especially those of the writer.","A personal organizer or appointment diary."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To keep a diary or journal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/diary"}],"entries":[{"title":"Hidden Diary","blocks":[{"text":"Hidden Diary is a 2009 Franco-Canadian drama film directed by Julie Lopes-Curval. The film tells the story of three generations of women, starring Catherine Deneuve, Marina Hands and Marie-Josée Croze."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/b/b4/M%C3%A8res_et_filles_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hidden_Diary","wikidata":"Q3332088"},{"title":"Diary","blocks":[{"text":"A diary is a written or audiovisual memorable record, with discrete entries arranged by date reporting on what has happened over the course of a day or other period. Diaries have traditionally been handwritten but are now also often digital. A personal diary may include a person's experiences, thoughts, and/or feelings, excluding comments on current events outside the writer's direct experience. Someone who keeps a diary is known as a diarist. Diaries undertaken for institutional purposes play a role in many aspects of human civilization, including government records, business ledgers, and military records. In British English, the word may also denote a preprinted journal format."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/The_Diary_of_a_Young_Girl_at_the_An